=======================================================
MULTI-SCHOOL ARCHITECTURE
=======================================================

FutureSchool will eventually support multiple schools.

Conceptually:

FutureSchool

    School A
        Students
        Parents
        Teachers
        Principal
        Admins
        Fees
        Academic Data

    School B
        Students
        Parents
        Teachers
        Principal
        Admins
        Fees
        Academic Data

Each school's data must remain isolated.

Every important business record should belong to a school/tenant.

The backend must enforce school isolation.

Frontend filtering is NOT security.

A user from School A must never access School B data by changing a URL, Student ID, API request or browser state.

