=======================================================
PAYMENTS
=======================================================

Regular school fees use four instalments:

1. School Opening
2. Before SA-1
3. Before SA-2
4. Before Pre-Final

Support:

Partial payment
Multi-term payment
Full-year payment
Transport fees
Concessions
Late fees
Credits
Refunds
Events fees
Offline payments

Online payment flow must eventually be:

Parent selects invoices
→ Backend loads authoritative invoices
→ Backend calculates amount
→ Backend creates payment order
→ Provider hosted checkout
→ Provider/bank authentication
→ Verified server-side callback/webhook
→ Payment recorded
→ Allocations recorded
→ Receipt generated
→ Reconciliation

Never trust payment success only from the browser.

Never store:

Card Number
CVV
UPI PIN
OTP
Bank Password

=======================================================
HALL TICKET
=======================================================

Admin configures which fee categories are required.

FutureSchool calculates:

CLEARED
or
PENDING

Class Teacher releases a Cleared Student's Hall Ticket.

Payment does NOT automatically release it.

Principal monitors and may perform a controlled exceptional override for an eligible Student.

=======================================================
HISTORICAL DATA
=======================================================

FutureSchool must preserve historical truth.

Do not create normal destructive workflow buttons such as:

Delete Payment
Delete Published Report Card
Delete Audit Record
Delete Historical Attendance

Use:

Versioning
Adjustments
Credits
Refunds
Corrections
Effective Dates
Audit Events

Examples:

Published Report Card correction:
Version 1 → SUPERSEDED
Version 2 → CURRENT

Student Transfer:
ACTIVE → TRANSFERRED

Staff Exit:
ACTIVE → EXITED

Academic Year:
ACTIVE → CLOSED / READ ONLY

